    "description": "The Events Ticketing History API allows users to access the historical data of ticketing transactions for events. This endpoint provides a comprehensive list of tickets sold, including details on event names, dates, and customer information. Ideal for event organizers and ticketing platforms, this API facilitates the analysis of ticket sales trends and customer engagement over time. Use cases include generating sales reports, understanding audience demographics, and enhancing future event planning strategies.",
